		(uuid "1abcdc1c-ce48-553e-a6fe-8537087c2541")
	)
	(text "10 x 47 k 2512 1 W (100 V each at 1000 V): back-up discharge, 2.4 W at 1000 V.\nREDCUBE studs: bus +/- to the power cells, terminal-side tap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.06 322.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "36fff802-5ec7-5161-942a-d42baeb3ab1e")
	)
	(text "TPSI3050 EN = K_DISCH OR FB_B_MAIN (2 x BAS16): powered = BSS138 holds the SiC gate low. Unpowered\n= the bus biases the gate (10 M, 15 V zener) -> 2 x 300 ohm Miba RST 200 discharge the bus. FB is high\nwhile the contactor is closed (or welded), so an E-stop or a lost K_DISCH cannot discharge a live port;\nFB keeps a running TPSI on, SYS energises K_DISCH first at power-up (27 mA start-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 295.44 245.344 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4cd63d78-089a-5d9f-a96f-3fdce794cd0a")
	)
	(text "CHASSIS-MOUNTED. 135 A port: gPV 160 A 1000 V DC in each pole, derated 124 A (fuses in the INLET air path,\nPD3: terminals / fuse bases only, creepage to PE >= 16.0 mm IIIa, IC-18/IC-21)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 50.764 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5ca01be0-9266-5545-9442-a703dc029274")
	)
	(text "FAIL-SAFE ACTIVE DISCHARGE, INHIBITED WHILE THE CONTACTOR IS CLOSED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 295.44 167.064 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "68ce9245-d216-502e-8d5f-2289fa7a4ff5")
	)
	(text "HVC43-250A-24MC, + pole, bidirectional (TDK p2). Opens at zero current in normal operation; cut-off\n450 A @ 1000 V once. K_B_MAIN feeds coil+ (S2M) AND gates the IRFL214 low side: two switches in the\npath. S10K30 directly across the coil = the only flyback path (>= 54 V down to drop-out; TDK p7 >= 50 V),\nV_DS <= 107 V. FB: NC mirror contact inverted by 1.5 k: FB_B_MAIN high = CLOSED (also feeds the TPSI EN OR).\nIC-05: coil + mirror contact to main >= 4400 V AC, Uimp 8 kV (HVC43MC p3): reinforced with the 6 kV credit\n(6.6 kV at 4000 m); insulation type not stated (TDK to confirm); coil/FB wiring >= 10 mm from the studs.\nPV-class port: no stiff source allowed (battery / DC bus = source battery)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 363.676 95.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6a00b3e9-8125-5f7f-a4db-971ffc175cc3")
	)
	(text "Channel 1: HOLD1 -> BSS138 -> IRFR9214 high side from the port +24V (not cut by E-stop) -> S2M -> coil+.\nChannel 2: IRFL214 low side coil- -> GND, gate fed from the channel-1 output (10 k / 22 k) and clamped\noff by a BSS138 unless HOLD2: it can only conduct while channel 1 conducts, so no flyback ever finds the\nSYS DO clamp. No single shorted switch energises the coil (report sec. 7.1 fault table)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 511.188 93.572 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6bbf9607-ffc0-5f02-839f-cdc72f75de68")
	)
